ound to the same Face subject and recipe region together whenever they fit a fresh lane/page; oversized groups retain existing finite continuation. Refs #6158, #5990.\n\nThe private layout helper reuses exact text measurement and command costs. It preserves Source/control order, frees consumed document text at the existing pace, and leaves the 48-command/192-byte/20-row/eight-surface limits unchanged. No portable schema or general layout framework changes.\n\nValidation on the current PR source: preflight 295, native-Face 111 (six new regressions), strict Clippy and formatting passed. Five normal-product QEMU runs passed: 22-checkpoint journey, wide/narrow panels and wide/narrow pointer interactions. All 12 controls remain reachable; typed edits and Boolean restoration are Source-accepted. The known 640×480 orphaned-help case is corrected.\n\n[Source/image-bound proof packet](https://github.com/dancxjo/conduit/blob/9aed8d8597480bebbb6b7f3ff3db9a4d6a57635b/task-6038/outputs/6158-stage05-e1c6dda63/receipt.json) · [checks](https://github.com/dancxjo/conduit/blob/9aed8d8597480bebbb6b7f3ff3db9a4d6a57635b/task-6038/outputs/6158-stage05-e1c6dda63/local-checks.json) · [audit](https://github.com/dancxjo/conduit/blob/9aed8d8597480bebbb6b7f3ff3db9a4d6a57635b/task-6038/work/6158-e1c6dda63-packet-audit.md) · [corrected screenshot](https://github.com/dancxjo/conduit/blob/aa7face54221ec1d4fb79f37e7a21ae290d81ddb/task-6038/outputs/6158-after-preview-e1c6dda63/arrival.png).\n\nThis is CPU and normal-product emulator evidence. Argument-bearing action rows and Suggest have pointer reachability, not separate dispatch proof; post-Birth release has QMP acknowledgement only. The original desktop screenshot's exact guest mode/image remains unknown. No physical, human, universal-layout or stable-release claim. Candidate and combined Integration remain separate acceptance gates.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:14Z","updated_at":"2026-1